#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 52aece1e9cd7451d8b2ed2ec7bac6bb7 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:9
msgid "Margin Trading"
msgstr "保证金交易"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 3ecc502040b64ac3bb3b2199c38aa344 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"Until now, our backtests have been limited to cash-only trades. This "
"notebook explores the margin trading features in **PyBroker v2**. We'll "
"use `StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__"
" to apply leverage to our buying power, calculate interest on borrowed "
"funds, and set up collateral for short positions."
msgstr ""
"到目前为止，我们的回测一直局限于纯现金交易。本文档将探讨 **PyBroker v2** 中的保证金交易功能。我们将使用 "
"`StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__"
" 为购买力设置杠杆、计算借入资金的利息，并为空头仓位设置抵押品。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 2d210210f3e848c4a9af0eb27c16b009 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:61
msgid "Configuring Leverage"
msgstr "配置杠杆"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 2866330182cb42ebba7d6a8d3ca0becd Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:63
msgid ""
"Margin is enabled with the `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__"
" config option, which multiplies buying power for both long and short "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"保证金通过 `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__"
" 配置项启用，它会为多头和空头仓位放大购买力。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 22da19a065be4289823c4aa0e0cd0dfc Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:84
msgid ""
"The default of ``1.0`` buys with cash only, and setting ``leverage`` to "
"``2.0`` allows holding positions worth up to 2x our equity. The borrowed "
"half of each position is tracked as a margin loan. **PyBroker** does not "
"model margin calls. Orders are instead limited to the available buying "
"power at fill time."
msgstr ""
"默认值 ``1.0`` 表示仅使用现金买入，将 ``leverage`` 设置为 ``2.0`` 则允许持有价值最高达自身权益 2 "
"倍的仓位，每个仓位中借入的那一半会作为保证金贷款进行跟踪。**PyBroker** 不模拟追缴保证金，订单只会在成交时受到可用购买力的限制。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 4c1c6a3a01fa4f059a34aff9a1d0b924 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:86
msgid ""
"Next, we write a simple trend-following strategy that holds a symbol "
"while it closes above its 50-day moving average:"
msgstr "接下来，我们编写一个简单的趋势跟踪策略，只要某个股票代码的收盘价高于其 50 日移动平均线，就持有该股票代码："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:115
#: f1ffb2c54532412aaf186c3aa0c76ffe
msgid ""
"Position sizing is where leverage comes into play. The "
"`ctx.calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" method sizes orders as a fraction of your deployable capital, which "
"equals your total equity multiplied by `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__."
msgstr ""
"杠杆正是在仓位规模计算中发挥作用的地方。`ctx.calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" 方法会按可部署资本的一定比例来确定订单规模，而这一资本等于你的总权益乘以 `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 807c7e14d4c54170bd749961fcd6719f Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:117
msgid ""
"As a result, targeting 25% across four stocks deploys up to roughly 2x "
"our equity when trading on margin:"
msgstr "因此，在使用保证金交易时，对四只股票各设定 25% 的目标配置，最终部署的资金最多可达自身权益的约 2 倍："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 62387277960f4b6a8d669eb80b76c170 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:533
msgid ""
"`result.portfolio "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult.portfolio>`__"
" records the margin balances on every bar. When a levered position is "
"opened, a portion of cash (``entry cost / leverage``) is posted as "
"collateral. The borrowed remainder is tracked in `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__,"
" and the `net_cash_balance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.net_cash_balance>`__"
" equals ``cash - margin_loan``."
msgstr ""
"`result.portfolio "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult.portfolio>`__"
" 会在每根 K 线记录保证金余额。开立杠杆仓位时，一部分现金（``entry cost / "
"leverage``）会作为抵押品被占用。借入的剩余部分会在 `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__"
" 中进行跟踪，而 `net_cash_balance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.net_cash_balance>`__"
" 等于 ``cash - margin_loan``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 4f778a45f2234aba82d0971839c0d8ff Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:536
msgid ""
"The `margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__"
" column is separate and tracks the current value of open short positions,"
" so it stays at zero when the strategy is long only."
msgstr ""
"`margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__"
" 列则是独立的，它跟踪未平仓空头仓位的当前价值，因此在只做多的策略中始终为零。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 482a1aa1c7e74c66bf38708beed3d485 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:538
msgid ""
"To see these margin mechanics in action, we filter the output to show "
"only bars with an outstanding loan:"
msgstr "为了实际观察这些保证金机制，我们对输出进行筛选，仅显示存在未偿还贷款的 K 线："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 7521d5fb68174c4f8232e83e1b47f9c2 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:751
msgid ""
"On the first of these filtered bars, a single entry filled. Cash dropped "
"by ``$25,413`` to post half of the entry cost as collateral, while the "
"``margin_loan`` column records the borrowed remainder. While the "
"collateral and margin loan are fixed at the entry price, the `notional "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.notional>`__"
" column tracks the position's current market value at each close."
msgstr ""
"在这些筛选出的 K 线中的第一根上，成交了一笔入场交易。现金减少了 ``$25,413``，用于将入场成本的一半作为抵押品，而 "
"``margin_loan`` 列则记录了借入的剩余部分。抵押品与保证金贷款按入场价格固定不变，而 `notional "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.notional>`__"
" 列会在每根 K 线收盘时跟踪该仓位的当前市值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 8743c6500eec47c187b8ea197ca77653 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:763
msgid "Comparing Against Cash-Only"
msgstr "与纯现金交易进行比较"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 13cee4bb9e3b4ed3b2c9fd0999a56c05 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:765
msgid ""
"To see the effect of leverage on our strategy, we rerun the strategy with"
" a cash only `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__"
" of ``1.0``. We also disable PyBroker's logging to keep the output clean "
"for the remaining runs using `disable_logging "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.disable_logging>`__:"
msgstr ""
"为了观察杠杆对策略的影响，我们将 `leverage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.leverage>`__"
" 设置为纯现金的 ``1.0`` 并重新运行策略。我们还会使用 `disable_logging "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.disable_logging>`__"
" 禁用 PyBroker 的日志记录，以保持后续运行的输出简洁："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 83ce95481e8d441e834388ea23a1b729 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:837
msgid "Charging Margin Interest"
msgstr "收取保证金利息"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:839
#: f5b7fdd55bd841c79110cfca60a7a272
msgid ""
"Leverage more than doubled the return (and nearly doubled the max "
"drawdown), but borrowing is not free. You can simulate this financing "
"cost using the `interest_rate "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.interest_rate>`__"
" config option. It applies an annual percentage rate to the portfolio's "
"net cash balance, accruing once per bar at ``interest_rate / "
"bars_per_year``. To use this feature, you must also set `bars_per_year "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year>`__."
msgstr ""
"杠杆使回报率提高了一倍多（最大回撤也几乎翻倍），但借入资金并非没有成本。你可以使用 `interest_rate "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.interest_rate>`__"
" 配置项来模拟这一融资成本：它会对投资组合的净现金余额按年利率计息，并以 ``interest_rate / bars_per_year`` "
"的比例按每根 K 线计提一次。要使用此功能，你还必须设置 `bars_per_year "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year>`__。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:842
#: ce531921046b4a7f9e1ec30609bc8740
msgid ""
"Interest is charged when net cash is negative (the margin loan exceeds "
"cash) and credited when net cash is positive. To see how these costs "
"affect the portfolio, we will backtest a buy-and-hold strategy. Because "
"both runs hold the same positions, any difference in their final market "
"value will be the interest paid:"
msgstr "当净现金为负（即保证金贷款超过现金）时会收取利息，当净现金为正时则会计入利息收益。为了观察这些成本对投资组合的影响，我们将回测一个买入并持有的策略。由于两次运行持有相同的仓位，它们最终市值的任何差额都是所支付的利息："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:910
#: a1ccaee135114f94aa3a2fc62c60214c
msgid ""
"Looking at the tail of the portfolio, ``cash`` will stay zero. Meanwhile,"
" the accrued interest is added to the `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__"
" and increases with every bar:"
msgstr ""
"观察投资组合的末尾部分，``cash`` 会始终保持为零。与此同时，计提的利息会被加到 `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__"
" 中，并随着每根 K 线不断增加："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:1059
#: cd7be1973f0e4b72a8abef3f5cc1274f
msgid "Shorting on Margin"
msgstr "使用保证金做空"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 05194da876fa4599b409b21fdcd0aeb4 Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:1061
msgid ""
"Short selling also uses margin. Shorts require collateral equal to "
"``entry cost / leverage`` and use the same buying power as long "
"positions."
msgstr "卖空同样会使用保证金。空头需要相当于 ``entry cost / leverage`` 的抵押品，并与多头共用同一份购买力。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:1063
#: e7a5fe80bc9a4b62917a637effbcde86
msgid ""
"To demonstrate this, we will short symbols trading below their moving "
"average. We will also enable `record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`__"
" to capture per-position balances:"
msgstr ""
"为了演示这一点，我们将做空那些价格低于其移动平均线的股票代码。我们还会启用 `record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`__"
" 来捕获每个仓位各自的余额："

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:1271
#: ce1cb5c9af054f81a390e03b55347403
msgid ""
"For open short positions, the `margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__"
" column tracks their current notional exposure, which can exceed your "
"total equity when using leverage."
msgstr ""
"对于未平仓的空头仓位，`margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__"
" 列会跟踪它们当前的名义敞口，在使用杠杆时，这一敞口可能超过你的总权益。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:1273
#: f646236740594f388f83e38ef64a665d
msgid ""
"When you open a short, collateral equal to ``entry cost / leverage`` is "
"held from your cash, and the `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__"
" column records the borrowed remainder. Because the collateral and the "
"loan are fixed at entry, they do not change with the ``margin`` column."
msgstr ""
"开立空头仓位时，会从你的现金中扣留相当于 ``entry cost / leverage`` 的抵押品，而 `margin_loan "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin_loan>`__"
" 列则记录借入的剩余部分。由于抵押品与贷款在入场时即已固定，它们不会随 ``margin`` 列变化。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. 5cf97132df3a47aabbaca2a0d088c73d Margin
#: Trading.ipynb:1275
msgid ""
"Your `net_cash_balance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.net_cash_balance>`__"
" equals your remaining cash minus this margin loan, turning negative if "
"the loan exceeds your available cash. Note that `equity "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.equity>`__"
" values shorts at their fixed entry cost, while `market_value "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.market_value>`__"
" includes their unrealized PnL."
msgstr ""
"你的 `net_cash_balance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.net_cash_balance>`__"
" 等于剩余现金减去这笔保证金贷款，一旦贷款超过可用现金，其数值就会变为负数。请注意，`equity "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.equity>`__"
" 按固定的入场成本为空头仓位估值，而 `market_value "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.market_value>`__"
" 则包含了它们的未实现盈亏。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/13. Margin Trading.ipynb:1278
#: deac05f949284a2fa2c1c9c4e9782415
msgid ""
"Because we enabled `record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`__,"
" `result.positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult.positions>`__"
" tracks the balances for each individual position. This includes each "
"short's specific share of the portfolio's `margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__,"
" as well as its own unrealized PnL:"
msgstr ""
"由于我们启用了 `record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`__，`result.positions"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult.positions>`__"
" 会跟踪每个单独仓位的余额。这包括每个空头仓位在投资组合 `margin "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.portfolio.html#pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar.margin>`__"
" 中所占的具体份额，以及它自身的未实现盈亏："

